COMMENT     The assembly wpPhyMedi1.hap1.1 is based on 85x PacBio data and
            Arima2 Hi-C data generated by the Aquatic Symbiosis Genomics
            Project (https://www.aquaticsymbiosisgenomics.org/). The assembly
            process included the following sequence of steps: initial PacBio
            assembly generation with Hifiasm in Hi-C integrated assembly mode,
            and Hi-C based scaffolding with YaHS. The mitochondrial genome was
            assembled using MitoHiFi and OATK. Finally, each haplotype assembly
            was analysed and manually improved using TreeVal. Chromosome-scale
            scaffolds confirmed by the Hi-C data have been named in order of
            size.
